    <body>
        <header>
            <h1>My Top 5 Liverpool Players</h1>
            <p>Liverpool is my favorite soccer club since I was a kid. I decided to share my five favorite Liverpool players based on talent, performance, and what they mean to me as a fan</p>
        </header>
        <main>
            <ol>
                <li>
                    <h2>Mohamed Salah</h2>
                    <p>Salah is my favorite Liverpool player. As someone from Egypt, Salah is my national hero growing up. I feel proud watching him succeed. I admire his speed, finishing, and dedication. I loved watching him breaking so many records over 9 years with Liverpool.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <h2>Steven Gerrard</h2>
                    <p>Gerrard represents the passion I love about Liverpool. His leadership and ability to score important goals make him one of my favorite players.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <h2>Virgil Van Dijk</h2>
                    <p>I enjoy watching Van Dijk because he makes defending look calm and controlled. His positioning and leadership stand out to me. I rate him as one of the best defender ever.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <h2>Sadio Mane</h2>
                    <p>Mane was exciting to watch because of his energy, speed, and determination. I especially enjoyed watching him attack alongside Salah.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <h2>Roberto Firmino</h2>
                    <p>Firmino is one of my favorites because of his creativity, skills, and teamwork. I loved how he helped other players score while making the game entertaining.</p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </main>
